  "name": "Black & White Three Pack Blister",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Released with the Black & White set in April 2011: three Black & White booster packs, a sampling pack of three common cards and a coin showing the Unova first partners, with one holofoil promo, Snivy BW06, Tepig BW07 or Oshawott BW08. The two-pack blister of the time held one booster pack and a sampling pack with one of the same three; a Ducklett version followed in June 2011. Their pictures first came in Japan, on cards given with Pokémon T-shirts from the clothing brand Uniqlo from 14 March 2011.",
